# =======================================================
# Chrysalis Public Open-Source Distribution .gitignore
# =======================================================

# 1. Personal Dynamic System State (Local / Drive Only)
System/Life-Roadmap.md
System/Scheduling-Memory.md
System/System-Health.md
System/Changelog.md

# 1b. Development Pipeline & Workstation Manifests (Local Dev Only)
System/Environment/

# 2. Personal TaskNotes & Daily Notes (Local / Drive Only)
TaskNotes/Tasks/*
!TaskNotes/Tasks/example-task.md
TaskNotes/Archive/*
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].md

# 3. Personal Projects & Slipbox Knowledge (Local / Drive Only)
Projects/*
!Projects/_templates/
!Projects/README.md
Slipbox/*
!Slipbox/README.md

# 4. API Keys, OAuth Credentials & Tokens
.env
*.token.json
credentials.json
token.json
System/Environment/scripts/*.token.json
.obsidian/plugins/nexus/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/text-generator/data.json

# 5. Obsidian Local UI Cache & Plugin Run Data
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache/
.trash/
.obsidian/plugins/tasknotes-workflows/runs/
.obsidian/plugins/nexus/data/
Nexus/data/
*.db

# 6. Agent Backups, Local Extensions & Scratchpads
.agent/skills/.backup/
.agent/skills/evolve/
System/Environment/temp/
.conversations/
.workspaces/

# 7. OS & Sync Conflict Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*(conflict*
* (conflict*
